{"text": "No, sir, that is not the generals dog, said Yeldyrin thoughtfully, because the general has only big hunting dogs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I know that myself, said Ochumelov, for the generals dogs are expensive, but this one has no fur and no shape at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If such an ugly dog were seen in Petersburg or Moscow, people would get rid of it at once without asking about the law. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Khryukin, you have been hurt, and we cannot let this matter drop, so the owner must be taught a lesson. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it may be the generals dog after all, Yeldyrin said, thinking aloud, for the owners name is not written on a dogs face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The other day I saw a dog just like this one in the yard of the house where the general lives. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of course it is the generals, shouted a voice from the crowd. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hmm, Yeldyrin, help me on with my coat, for a wind is getting up, and I feel cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Take the dog to the generals house and ask there, and tell them that I found it and sent it to them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Ochumelov turned to Khryukin and shouted, And you, put your silly finger down, for it is your own fault.", "alignment": {"characters": ["N", "o", ",", " ", "s", "i", "r", ",", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", "s", " ", "d", "o", "g", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "Y", "e", "l", "d", "y", "r", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", "f", "u", "l", "l", "y", ",", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "u", "s", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "d", "o", "g", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", 